sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
actor Admin
participant Browser
participant Security as SecurityHeaders
participant RBAC as AccessControl
participant RateLimiter
participant API as ApplicationAPI
participant Metrics as Observability
participant Store as SupabaseDB
participant Agent as AgentRuntime

User->>Browser: Initiate action
Browser->>Security: Add headers
Security-->>Browser: Headers applied
Browser->>RBAC: Check permissions
RBAC-->>Browser: Authorized
Browser->>RateLimiter: Consume token
RateLimiter-->>Browser: Allowed
Browser->>API: Request with payload and tenant
API->>Metrics: Record request
API->>Store: Persist data
Store-->>API: Ack
API-->>Browser: Response
Admin->>API: Query analytics
API->>Store: Aggregate points
Store-->>API: Result
API-->>Admin: Render overlay
API->>Agent: Dispatch task
Agent-->>API: Status update
API->>Metrics: Record success
